function parseRangeMax(value){const text=String(value).trim();return text==='+'?'+':text===''?NaN:Number(text);}
function rangeUpper(key){return key.max==='+'?Infinity:Number(key.max);}
// Admin owns calculation definitions; templates own numeric values and lookup bands.
const lookupDataType=t=>({int:'Integer',integer:'Integer',float:'Float',double:'Float',decimal:'Float',number:'Number',percentage:'Percentage',char:'Character',varchar:'Character',string:'Character'}[String(t).trim().toLowerCase()]||t);
const numericType=t=>['Integer','Float','Number','Percentage'].includes(lookupDataType(t));
function lookupDimensions(c){const u=state.units.find(u=>u.id===c.unit);return c.attrs.slice(0,c.lookup==='2D Lookup'?2:1).map(name=>({name,type:lookupDataType(u?.attributes.find(a=>a.name===name)?.type||'Character')}))}
function lookupMatches(c,r,record){return lookupDimensions(c).every((d,i)=>{const v=record[d.name],key=r.keys[i];if(v==null||v==='')return false;if(numericType(d.type)){return key&&typeof key==='object'&&Number(v)>=Number(key.min)&&Number(v)<rangeUpper(key)}return String(v)===String(key)})}
function validateLookup(c){if(c.basis!=='Per Unit'||c.lookup==='Flat'||!c.rates)return;const dims=lookupDimensions(c);for(const r of c.rates){if(r.keys.length!==dims.length||!Number.isFinite(r.value)||r.value<0)throw Error('Complete every lookup row with a valid value.');dims.forEach((d,i)=>{const k=r.keys[i];if(numericType(d.type)){if(!k||typeof k!=='object'||!Number.isFinite(k.min)||(k.max!=='+'&&!Number.isFinite(k.max))||rangeUpper(k)<=k.min)throw Error(d.name+': enter a valid From / To range.');if(d.type==='Integer'&&(!Number.isInteger(k.min)||(k.max!=='+'&&!Number.isInteger(k.max))))throw Error(d.name+': integer ranges require whole-number boundaries.');}else if(typeof k!=='string'||!k.trim())throw Error('Enter a category for '+d.name);});if(c.valueType==='Integer'&&!Number.isInteger(r.value))throw Error('Integer values require whole numbers.');}for(let i=0;i<c.rates.length;i++)for(let j=i+1;j<c.rates.length;j++){const a=c.rates[i],b=c.rates[j];if(dims.every((d,k)=>numericType(d.type)?a.keys[k].min<rangeUpper(b.keys[k])&&b.keys[k].min<rangeUpper(a.keys[k]):a.keys[k]===b.keys[k]))throw Error('Lookup rows overlap. Each unit must match at most one row.');}}
ratesFor=function(c){if(c.basis!=='Per Unit'||c.lookup==='Flat')return [];const dims=lookupDimensions(c);let combos=[[]];for(const d of dims){const u=state.units.find(u=>u.id===c.unit);const values=numericType(d.type)?[{min:0,max:1}]:u?.sample?[...new Set(sampleUnits.filter(x=>x.status==='Delivered').map(x=>x[d.name]).filter(x=>x!=null).map(String))]:[''];combos=combos.flatMap(x=>values.map(v=>[...x,clone(v)]));}return combos.map(keys=>({keys,value:0}));};
function lookupTable(c,i){const dims=lookupDimensions(c);return `<p class="quiet">${dims.map(d=>`${esc(d.name.replaceAll('_',' '))}: ${d.type==='Integer'?'Integer range (whole numbers)':numericType(d.type)?'Numeric range (decimals allowed)':'category list'}`).join(' · ')}</p>${dims.some(d=>numericType(d.type))?'<p class="quiet">Enter a From and To range for every numeric attribute. From is included; To is excluded. Integer boundaries must be whole numbers; Float boundaries may contain decimals. Use + for the final To value to cover everything from that From value onward.</p>':''}${table([...dims.map(d=>esc(d.name.replaceAll('_',' '))),'Value',''],(c.rates||[]).map((r,j)=>row([...dims.map((d,k)=>numericType(d.type)?`<div class="grid"><label>From (inclusive)<input type="number" step="${d.type==='Integer'?'1':'any'}" data-k="components.${i}.rates.${j}.keys.${k}.min" value="${esc(r.keys[k]?.min??'')}"></label><label>To (exclusive)<input type="text" data-range-max placeholder="Number or +" data-k="components.${i}.rates.${j}.keys.${k}.max" value="${esc(r.keys[k]?.max??'')}"></label></div>`:`<input data-k="components.${i}.rates.${j}.keys.${k}" value="${esc(r.keys[k]??'')}" aria-label="${esc(d.name)} category">`),`<input type="number" step="${c.valueType==='Integer'?'1':'any'}" data-k="components.${i}.rates.${j}.value" value="${esc(r.value)}" aria-label="Value">`,`<button data-lookup-remove="${i}|${j}">Remove</button>`])))}<button data-lookup-add="${i}">${dims.some(d=>numericType(d.type))?'+ Add range':'+ Add category'}</button>`}
function formulaControl(c,i,path='formula',formula=c.formula){const previous=draft.components.slice(0,i).map(x=>({id:x.id,name:x.name}));const unit=state.units.find(u=>u.id===c.unit);const values=[{id:'value',name:'Template value'},...sharedKeys.filter(k=>(c.keys||[]).includes(k.id)||k.id===c.primary),...(c.basis==='Per Unit'?(unit?.attributes||[]).filter(a=>numericType(a.type)).map(a=>({id:a.name,name:a.name})):[]),...previous,{id:'running_payout',name:'Running payout'}];return `<label class="section-gap">Formula ${help('value comes from the template. Percentages are converted to fractions. Use +, -, *, /, MIN and MAX.')}<input data-k="components.${i}.${path}" value="${esc(formula)}"></label><p class="quiet">${values.map(v=>`${esc(v.name)}: <code>${esc(formulaKey(v.id))}</code>`).join(' · ')}</p>`}
const simpleComponentValues=componentForm;
componentForm=function(c,i){let html=simpleComponentValues(c,i);html=html.replace(/<label[^>]*>(?:(?!<label)[\s\S])*?<input[^>]*data-k="components\.\d+\.(?:defaultValue|skip|unitFilterValue|filters\.\d+\.value|rules\.\d+\.(?:min|max|value|secondaryMax))"[^>]*><\/label>/g,'');html=html.replace(/<div class="formula">[\s\S]*?<\/div>/g,'');const addition=`${select('Value type',`components.${i}.valueType`,['Integer','Float','Percentage'],c.valueType)}${!c.rules.length&&c.formula==='value'?formulaControl(c,i):!c.rules.length&&c.basis!=='Fixed'?formulaControl(c,i):''}${availableKeysDropdown(c,i)}<p class="quiet">Amounts, rates and targets are entered in the template.</p>`;return html.replace(/<\/div><\/section>$/,addition+'</div></section>')};
ruleForm=function(c,i,manager){return c.rules.map((r,j)=>`<div class="rule"><div class="rule-head"><h3>${manager?'Slab':'Rule'} ${j+1}</h3>${manager?btn('Remove','remove-rule',`${i}|${j}`):''}</div>${manager?`<div class="grid3">${input('From',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.min`,r.min,'number')}${input('To',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.max`,r.max,'number')}${input('Value',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.value`,r.value,'number')}</div><p class="quiet">${esc(r.when)} · ${r.exclude==='NA'?'No exclusion':esc(r.exclude)}</p><code class="formula">${esc(r.formula)}</code>${r.secondary?input(displayKey(r.secondary)+' target ≥',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.secondaryMax`,r.secondaryMax,'number'):''}`:`<div class="grid">${select('Applicable when',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.when`,['Slab not achieved','Slab achieved','Both'],r.when)}${select('Stop when',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.exclude`,[{id:'NA',name:'Never'},{id:'Any subsequent slab achieved',name:'A later slab is achieved'}],r.exclude)}</div>${formulaControl(c,i,`rules.${j}.formula`,r.formula)}${select('Additional target key',`components.${i}.rules.${j}.secondary`,[{id:'',name:'None'},...sharedKeys.filter(f=>c.keys.includes(f.id)&&f.id!==c.primary)],r.secondary||'')}`}</div>`).join('')+(manager?btn('+ Add slab','add-rule',i):'');};
const simpleMGValues=mgControls;
mgControls=function(c,i,manager=false){let html=simpleMGValues(c,i,manager);if(!manager)html=html.replace(/<label[^>]*>(?:(?!<label)[\s\S])*?<input[^>]*data-k="components\.\d+\.rules\.0\.(?:value|max)"[^>]*><\/label>/g,'')+formulaControl(c,i,'rules.0.formula',c.rules[0].formula);return html};
templateForm=function(){const s=structure(draft.structure);modal(draft.name||'Create template',`<div class="grid">${input('Template name','name',draft.name)}${select('Payout structure','structure',[{id:'',name:'Select structure'},...current(state.structures).filter(x=>x.status==='Live')],draft.structure)}</div>${s?`<p class="quiet section-gap">${esc(s.lob)} / ${esc(s.entity)} · ${s.period}</p>${draft.components.map((c,i)=>`<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>${esc(c.name)}</h3><span class="tag">${payoutType(c)} · ${c.effect}</span></div><div class="panel-body">${payoutType(c)==='Minimum Guarantee'?mgControls(c,i,true):c.basis==='Per Unit'&&c.lookup!=='Flat'?lookupTable(c,i):c.rules.length?ruleForm(c,i,true):input(c.basis==='Fixed'?'Amount':'Value',`components.${i}.defaultValue`,c.defaultValue,'number')}${c.basis==='Per Unit'&&c.unitFilterKey?input('Unit filter · '+c.unitFilterKey+' '+c.unitFilterOp,`components.${i}.unitFilterValue`,c.unitFilterValue):''}${(c.filters||[]).map((f,j)=>input(displayKey(f.key)+' '+f.op,`components.${i}.filters.${j}.value`,f.value)).join('')}${!c.rules.length?`<code class="formula">${esc(c.formula)}</code>`:''}</div></section>`).join('')}`:''}`,btn('Save template','save-template','',true))};
const baseValidationValues=validateStructure;
validateStructure=function(s){const check=clone(s);if(editorType==='structure')for(const c of check.components){if(c.unitFilterKey&&!c.unitFilterValue)c.unitFilterValue=c.unitFilterOp==='BETWEEN'?'0,1':'0';for(const f of c.filters||[])if(!String(f.value).trim())f.value=f.op==='BETWEEN'?'0,1':'0';}baseValidationValues(check);for(const c of s.components){validateLookup(c);const key=sharedKeys.find(k=>k.id===c.primary);for(const r of c.rules||[])if(key?.type==='Integer'&&(!Number.isInteger(r.min)||!Number.isInteger(r.max)))throw Error('Integer performance keys require whole-number slab boundaries.');}};
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const add=e.target.closest('[data-lookup-add]'),remove=e.target.closest('[data-lookup-remove]');if(add){const c=draft.components[Number(add.dataset.lookupAdd)];c.rates||=[];c.rates.push({keys:lookupDimensions(c).map(d=>numericType(d.type)?{min:0,max:1}:''),value:0});templateForm()}if(remove){const [i,j]=remove.dataset.lookupRemove.split('|');draft.components[i].rates.splice(Number(j),1);templateForm()}});
render();

function syncTemplateDefinitions(s){for(const t of state.templates.filter(t=>t.structure===s.id)){t.components=s.components.map(def=>{const old=t.components.find(c=>c.id===def.id);if(!old)return {...clone(def),rates:ratesFor(def)};return {...clone(def),defaultValue:old.defaultValue,skip:old.skip,payoutType:old.payoutType,matrixBehaviour:old.matrixBehaviour,rates:clone(old.rates||[]),unitFilterValue:old.unitFilterValue,filters:(def.filters||[]).map((f,i)=>({...clone(f),value:old.filters?.[i]?.value??f.value})),rules:def.rules.length?(old.rules.length?old.rules:def.rules).map((r,j)=>({...clone(def.rules[j]||def.rules[0]),min:r.min,max:r.max,value:r.value,secondaryMax:r.secondaryMax,targets:clone(r.targets||{})})):[]};});}}
// Keep a configured performance calculation present in every template.
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-action="remove-rule"]');if(editorType==='template'&&b){const i=Number(b.dataset.id.split('|')[0]);if(draft.components[i].rules.length===1){e.stopImmediatePropagation();e.preventDefault();notify('Keep at least one slab for this configured calculation.');}}},true);
const validateTypedValueDefinition=validateStructure;
validateStructure=function(s){if(editorType==='structure')for(const c of s.components)for(const r of c.rules||[])r.valueType=c.valueType;validateTypedValueDefinition(s);};

// Clear obsolete unit-filter defaults in existing page-session configurations.
for(const item of [...state.structures,...state.templates])for(const c of item.components)if(c.basis!=='Per Unit'){c.unitFilterKey='';c.unitFilterValue='';}
save();
